WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.422
Every function has two important moments: definition and call.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:10.272
The definition tells Python what instructions belong to the function.

00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:17.422
Def show_welcome with parentheses creates the function and the indented lines become its body.

00:00:17.422 --> 00:00:24.062
Calling show_welcome with parentheses tells Python to actually run those stored instructions.

00:00:24.606 --> 00:00:27.013
The colon and indentation matter.

00:00:27.013 --> 00:00:31.453
They mark where the function body begins and which lines belong to it.
